{"sourceUrl":"https://sia.cas.cn/zpjy/yjsjy/zs/zsgg/202605/t20260525_8208968.html","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:51:37.790297+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://sia.cas.cn/zpjy/yjsjy/zs/zsgg/202605/t20260525_8208968.html","html":"<div>\n<div><p><span><span>沈阳自动化研究所成立于</span><span>1958</span><span>年</span></span><span>，</span><span>是我国最早从事机器人研究的科研机构，是国家最早批复建设的机器人</span><span><span>技术国家工程研究中心</span></span><span>，</span><span><span>开创了我国机器人学领域的先河。主要研究方向是机器人、智能制造与光电信息技术。在自动化科学与工程领域不断探索，为国民经济、社会发展和国家安全做出了突出贡献，获得国家、中国科学院、各部委及地方奖励</span> <span>3</span></span><span><span>94</span></span><span> <span>项。</span></span></p><p><span>作为中国机器人事业的摇篮，在中国机器人事业发展历史上创造了二十多个第一，引领了中国机器人技术的研究发展，</span><span>面向</span><span><span>机器人与智能制造领域着重开展创新研究，在机器人学、工业机器人、水下机器人、空间机器人及自动化、特种机器人、先进光电技术与系统、无线传感与通信技术、机器人化工艺装备及智能产线等研究与开发方面取得大批成果，形成技术领先优势。成功孵化了沈阳新松机器人自动化股份有限公司、沈阳芯源微电子设备股份有限公司等</span> <span>10 </span><span>余家高技术企业。</span></span></p><p><span>今天的沈阳自动化</span><span>研究</span><span><span>所已发展成为具有现代化科研与工作条件、具有一流科学家和科技队伍的国立科研机构，是</span><span>“</span></span><span>机器人与智能系统全国重点实验室</span><span>”“机器人技术国家工程研究中心”“国家机器人创新中心”“国家机器人质量监督检验中心（辽宁）”等十多个国家和省部级平台的依托单位</span><span>。</span><span>牵头承办中国科学院大学机器人与智能制造学院。主办中国核心刊物《机器人》和《信息与控制》。</span></p><p><span><span>为让大学生了解沈阳自动化研究所在机器人、智能制造和光电信息技术等领域的研究特色和科研实力，感受科研氛围和研究生培养特色，引导与激发大学生的科研兴趣和热情，我所将于</span><span>202</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span>年</span><span><span>7</span></span><span>月举行</span><span>大学生夏令营</span><span>活动。现面向全国高校招收营员，并将相关安排及注意事项公告如下：</span></p><p><strong><span>一、时间与规模</span></strong></p><p><span>预计时间：</span></p><p><span>第一批次：</span><span><span>202</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span><span>年</span><span>7</span><span>月</span></span><span><span>13</span></span><span>日</span><span>—</span><span><span>7</span><span>月</span></span><span><span>17</span></span><span>日；</span></p><p><span>第二批次：</span><span><span>7</span><span>月</span></span><span><span>20</span></span><span>日</span><span>—</span><span><span>7</span><span>月</span></span><span><span>24</span></span><span>日</span><span>；</span></p><p><span>预计规模：每</span><span><span>批次</span><span>150</span></span><span>人左右</span><span>；</span></p><p><span>具体形式：</span><span>现场</span><span>夏令营</span><span>。</span></p><p><strong><span>二、主要内容</span></strong></p><p><span><span>1.</span></span><span>参加院士、专家主讲的学术报告，了解</span><span>科技前沿</span><span>；</span></p><p><span><span>2.</span></span><span>参观</span><span>研究所园区</span><span><span>、成果展览室及部分研究室；</span> </span></p><p><span><span>3.</span></span><span>组织营员到感兴趣的课题组进行科研体验；</span></p><p><span><span>4.</span></span><span>组织营员与我所在读研究生进行交流</span><span>研讨</span><span>。</span><span> </span></p><p><strong><span><span>三、招收对象</span> </span></strong></p><p><span><span>1.</span></span><span><span>全国各高校将于</span><span>202</span></span><span><span>7</span></span><span>年毕业的自动化、</span><span>机械、</span><span>计算机、</span><span>人工智能、</span><span>通信、</span><span>机器人工程、智能制造、船舶与海洋工程、</span><span>电气、物理、光学</span><span>、</span><span>数学</span><span>等相关专业的在校本科生，具有推免资格的学生优先接收；</span></p><p><span><span>2.</span></span><span>申请人在大学本科阶段学习成绩优异，在学期间无重修科目或补考记录，在校期间没有受过纪律处分；</span></p><p><span><span>3.</span></span><span>一般应通过全国大学英语四级考试；</span></p><p><span><span>4.</span></span><span>具有较强的调查研究、综合分析问题、解决问题能力；</span></p><p><span><span>5.</span></span><span>身心健康，无不良记录。</span></p><p><strong><span>四、夏令营资助</span></strong></p><p><span><span>1.</span></span><span>夏令营期间在沈阳的食宿</span><span>；</span></p><p><span><span>2.</span></span><span><span>单程路费。实报实销营员从高校或家庭所在城市至沈阳的火车硬座（含高铁二等座）、硬卧（单程</span><span>8</span><span>小时以上）或轮船三等舱及以下的</span></span><span>车</span><span>船票费用，沈阳市内车费不予报销，</span><strong><span>乘坐飞机</span></strong><strong><span>按照</span></strong><strong><span>不超过</span></strong><strong><span>高铁二等座报销</span></strong><span>；</span></p><p><span><span>3.</span></span><span>对于通过推免考核并录取为我所</span><span><span>202</span></span><span><span>7</span></span><span>年研究生的营员，在入学报到后为其报销返程车船费，请保存好返程车船票。</span></p><p><strong><span>五、奖</span></strong><strong><span>助</span></strong><strong><span>学金</span></strong></p><p><span><span>1.</span><span>优秀推免生奖学金（全覆盖）</span></span></p><p><span>为</span><span>录取至所内的</span><span>优秀高校推免生提供</span><span>丰厚</span><span>奖励，</span><span><span>按照院校及综合成绩全员发放，最高为</span><span>10</span><span>万元</span><span>/</span><span>人</span></span><span>。</span></p><p><span><span>2.</span><span>基本奖助学金（全覆盖）</span></span></p><p><span><span>硕士奖学金：</span><span>2800-5340</span><span>元</span><span>/</span><span>月</span></span></p><p><span><span>博士奖学金：</span><span>5100-10340</span><span>元</span><span>/</span><span>月</span></span></p><p><span><span>3.</span><span>学业奖助学金（全覆盖）</span></span></p><p><span><span>硕士学业奖学金：</span><span>8000-12000</span><span>元</span><span>/</span><span>年</span></span></p><p><span><span>博士学业奖学金：</span><span>10800-18000</span><span>元</span><span>/</span><span>年</span></span></p><p><span><span>4.</span><span>其他奖学金</span></span></p><p><span>    <span>可申报国家奖学金、中国科学院院长奖学金和各类冠名奖学金等。</span></span></p><p><strong><span>六、申请办法及时间要求</span></strong></p><p><span><span>1.</span></span><span>夏令营报名</span><span>以网上报名方式进行</span><span>，网上报名需要在</span><span><span>7</span></span><span>月</span><span><span>2</span></span><span>日之前完成，逾期</span><span>不再受理</span><span>！</span></p><p><span><span>2.</span></span><span>报名流程（以下</span><span>两</span><span>步骤缺一不可）</span></p><p><span><span>（</span><span>1</span><span>）网上报名</span></span></p><p><span><span>登录科教结合协同育人行动计划网站（</span><span>http://kjxt.ucas.ac.cn/</span><span>），选择“夏令营”栏目，选择“沈阳自动化研究所优秀大学生夏令营”。此网址为中国科学院大学夏令营网上申报系统</span></span><span>，</span><span>请及时申报</span><span>。</span></p><p><span><span>（</span><span>2</span><span>）提供申请材料</span></span></p><p><strong><span>注：报名时不需要提供申请材料；确定获取入营资格后</span></strong><strong><span>再</span></strong><strong><span>提交</span></strong><strong><span>，提交方式另行通知。</span></strong></p><p><span>①</span><span>《</span><span>中国科学院大学大学生夏令营申请表</span><span>》</span><span>一份；</span></p><p><span>②两封推荐信，推荐人须具有</span><strong><span>副教授或相</span></strong><strong><span>当</span></strong><strong><span>及</span></strong><strong><span>以上</span></strong><span><span>职称（详见附件</span><span>1</span><span>）；</span></span></p><p><span>③本科学校教务部门（或院系）出具并加盖公章的大学本科成绩单以及成绩排名证明（无固定格式要求）；</span></p><p><span><span>④《沈阳自动化研究所研究生政治审查表》（详见附件</span><span>2</span><span>）；</span></span></p><p><span>⑤</span><span>《沈阳自动化研究所夏令营活动安全责任协议书》</span><span>（详见附件</span><span><span>3</span></span><span>）</span><span>；</span></p><p><span>⑥</span><span>获奖证明材料（体现自身学术水平的代表性学术论文复印件、获奖证书复印件、英语四、六级证书复印件等）</span><span>。</span></p><p><span>请将申请材料按照申请表、推荐信、成绩单、政审表、</span><span>责任协议书、</span><span><span>获奖证明材料顺序排好，</span><span>A4</span><span>纸打印，左侧装订。</span></span></p><p><span><span>3.</span></span><span>公布入营名单</span></p><p><strong><span>网上资格审核工作将于</span></strong><strong><span><span>7</span></span></strong><strong><span>月</span></strong><strong><span><span>3</span></span></strong><strong><span>日结束，</span></strong><strong><span><span>7</span></span></strong><strong><span>月</span></strong><strong><span><span>3</span></span></strong><strong><span>日</span></strong><strong><span><span>17:00</span></span></strong><strong><span>后</span></strong><strong><span>，申请状态</span></strong><strong><span>除</span></strong><strong><span>“</span></strong><strong><span>通过</span></strong><strong><span>”</span></strong><strong><span><span>之外，其余都是未录取（如状态显示</span><span>“未审核”</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>或</span><span>“未通过”等相关状态，说明审核没有通过</span></span></strong><strong><span>）</span></strong><strong><span>。</span></strong><span>届时未接到录取通知的同学皆为未入选者，不再另行通知。</span></p><p><strong><span>七、后续活动安排</span></strong></p><p><span>夏令营日程安排、批次选择等事宜</span><span>，</span><span>审核通过后另行通知</span><strong><span>。</span></strong></p><p><span><span>审核通过后，如遇特殊情况无法参加夏令营可发送邮件至</span><span>zs@sia.cn</span><span>说明情况。</span></span></p><p><strong><span>八、联系方式</span></strong></p><p><span>联系人</span><span>电话：</span></p><p><span><span>吴老师：</span><span>024</span></span><span><span>-2397</span></span><span><span>0457</span></span></p><p><span>通讯地址：辽宁省沈阳市</span><span>浑南区创新路</span><span><span>135</span><span>号</span><span>3</span><span>号楼</span></span></p><p><span><span>邮政编码：</span><span>110169</span></span></p><p><span><span>E-mail: </span></span><a href=\"mailto:zs@sia.cn\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><span>zs@sia.cn</span></span></a></p><p><span><span>QQ</span><span>交流群：</span></span><span><span>1106760560</span></span><span>（</span><span>审核通过后加入，注明姓名</span><span><span>）</span> </span></p><p><span><span>网址：</span><span>http://www.sia.cas.cn/zpjy/yjsjy/</span></span></p><p><span><span>导师介绍：</span><span>http://www.sia.cas.cn/zpjy/yjsjy/dsjj/</span></span></p><p><strong><span>九、其他</span></strong></p><p><span>夏令营活动</span><span>日程安排如有变化请及时关注</span><span>沈阳自动化研究所研究生教育</span><span>公众号</span><span>和</span><span>官网</span><span>中的公告。</span></p><p><span><span>附件</span><span>1</span><span>：《专家推荐书》</span></span></p><p><span><span>附件</span><span>2</span><span>：《沈阳自动化研究所研究生政治审查表》</span></span></p><p><span>附件</span><span><span>3</span></span><span>：《沈阳自动化研究所夏令营活动安全责任协议书》</span></p><p><br/></p><p><span> </span></p><p><span>                         </span><span>中国科学院沈阳自动化研究所</span></p><p><span>                                   </span><span>招生办</span></p><p><span>                               </span><span><span>202</span></span><span><span>6</span></span><span>年</span><span><span>5</span></span><span>月</span><span><span>25</span></span><span>日</span></p><p><br/></p></div>\n</div>","textSha256":"995bc86dc1dea13c50798afcba9d2fe51fe4d980c7e99831965466e367eb8883","textLength":2412,"sourceSha256":"0dd8edd05945c7e127d0d6777959bda396d9b5dacf295b9d91a68f345dfb6fde","selector":"#zoom","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-c873732346fbaf2789e3","title":"2026年中国科学院沈阳自动化研究所关于举办2026年“机器人与智能制造”优秀大学生夏令营通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:51:37.790297+00:00"}
